  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5505.04 Law Enforcement List.\n\n(a) The division shall maintain a law enforcement list of all tier I, tier II, and tier III offenders required to register pursuant to RSA 651-B, and all offenders reported to the division pursuant to RSA 651-B:4.\n\n(b) The law enforcement list shall include the information outlined in RSA 651-B:7, II.\n\n(c) The law enforcement list shall not be made available to the public but shall be made available to law enforcement officials for valid law enforcement purposes.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99; rpld by #7982, INTERIM eff 10-30-03\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
